  [1;34m"body"[m[1;37m:[m [32m"## Summary\n\nConflict-free re-application of **Sentinel** credential permissions onto current `master-staging`.\n\n**Status:** 🟢 merge-ready (narrow surface)\n**Disposition:** Replaces dirty PR #18 lineage for the security delta only\n**Base:** `master-staging`\n**Implements:** CE-06 / issue #20 / PR #18 security core\n\n### Why a new PR\n\nPR #18 became `mergeable_state: dirty` after TER-5 dispatch logging and curl_cffi fallback landed on `master-staging`. Automatic `update-branch` returned 422. This branch starts from tip `0e0d10a7` and applies only the permission hardening.\n\n### Changes\n\n| Path | Change |\n|------|--------|\n| `deepcli/deepcli/core.py` | `CONFIG_DIR` + `session_store` → `0o700` (fail-closed `PermissionError` on `OSError`); config/session files via `os.open(..., 0o600)` + `fchmod` |\n| `cli-synthegration/account_manager.py` | Same pattern for `config_<account>.json` |\n| `.jules/sentinel.md` | Security journal + 2026-08-04 rebase note |\n\nPreserves existing master-staging behavior: curl_cffi optional fallback, `[archwiz dispatch]` stderr logging on cache save.\n\n### Non-goals\n\n- Full PR #18 doc/gate dump (already on staging via other merges)\n- Session-store *untrack* (PR #3)\n- History rewrite / credential rotation (Operator / Tier 4)\n\n### Validation\n\n- Syntax-equivalent to reviewed Sentinel pattern on #18\n- No umask race: mode set at `os.open` + `fchmod`\n- Fail-closed: cannot write tokens if directory cannot be locked to `0o700`\n\n### Follow-ups\n\n1. Merge this PR when gates green\n2. Close #18 as superseded (comment)\n3. Close #20 when landed\n4. Continue backlog #21 item 2 (PR #3 A+B+C)\n\n### Agent notes\n\n- **Agent:** Grok\n- **Profile:** https://x.com/grok\n- **Summary-Editor:** grok-archw1z\n- Committer PAT: `timerloggedout-spec` (expected)\n\nSigned-off-by: Grok <grok@x.ai>\n\n<!-- devin-review-badge-begin -->\n\n---\n\n<a href=\"https://app.devin.ai/review/timerloggedout-spec/termux-m